WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Local CPU research app. This walkthrough uses generated
DICOMs only.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Run local analysis sends the generated study to one
bounded CPU worker.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Completed on CPU with 40 valid windows. Phantom scores
have no medical meaning.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Five input slots group MRI planes and fat-suppression
settings.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Change plane or sampled window to inspect the actual
model input crops.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Twelve study-level scores. They are uncalibrated, not
diagnostic decisions.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Download result JSON to inspect model identity, masks,
warnings and timing.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Project-trained ConvNeXt-Tiny: 0.833 public macro AUC.
Research use only.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Clear study resets the viewer and removes the
processing job. No cloud inference.
